	(text "Local USB-C port per spec §8. KTS1693: external OVLO 100k / 27.4k 0.1 % trips 5.38-5.78 V, under the MDBT50Q VBUS pad 5.8 V abs-max (E22; internal 5.77-6.13 V);\nISET 4.99k -> OCP 1.82-2.18 A (datasheet Table 1 at 5.00k, 0-70 C), under the LM66200's 2.5 A; EN tied low, OC_MODE low = latch off;\nACOK is open-drain, pulled up on the core. CDET unused. D504 (TVS2200 on connector VBUS) is a DNP footprint.\nUSBLC6-2SC6 VBUS (pin 5) is on VBUS_LOCAL, never on connector VBUS (5.5 V abs-max).\nCC1/CC2: 5.1k Rd (0805 for a 20 V CC short) and TVS2200 (22 V VRWM); the core adds 100k in series before AINx.\nJ_USB is reversal-safe: an end-reversed cable keeps VBUS on VBUS and GND on GND; D+/D- swap and USB does not enumerate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 177.8 0.0000)
